format 1
adapter feed 1
npc: npc-tess

post ft-tess-chest-daily
kind: celebrate
trigger: chest_opened
chip: quests
condition: {"period":"daily"}

text:
    Ping. Daily chest opened. Small reward, tiny habit, big streak potential.

post ft-tess-chest-weekly
kind: celebrate
trigger: chest_opened
chip: quests
condition: {"period":"weekly"}

text:
    Weekly chest unlocked! Every quest of the week done. Gadget level: maxed out.

post ft-tess-first-lesson
kind: celebrate
trigger: first_lesson
chip: lesson

text:
    First lesson done: “{lesson}”. Unlocked! Lots more shiny things ahead.

post ft-tess-quests
kind: celebrate
trigger: daily_quests_done
chip: quests

text:
    All daily quests, claimed. Done and done. Go tap that chest.

post ft-tess-rank-passed
kind: celebrate
trigger: rank_change
chip: ranks
condition: {"direction":"passed"}

text:
    Ooh, you passed {rival} in the weekly ranking. Zoom! Keep that speed.

post ft-tess-comeback-14
kind: nudge
trigger: comeback
condition: {"minDays":14}

text:
    Hey {name}, long time. Rebooting is easy: one lesson and you are right back in.

post ft-tess-comeback-3
kind: nudge
trigger: comeback
condition: {"minDays":3}

text:
    Welcome back, {name}. Quick one: pick up where you stopped. I kept your place.

post ft-tess-rank-passed-by
kind: nudge
trigger: rank_change
chip: ranks
condition: {"direction":"passed_by"}

text:
    {rival} just passed you in the weekly ranking. Quick fix: one lesson. Go, go.
